le to make bigger stuff  in the long run and i don't know where  this is going to take me but i expect it  will be kind of a consistent hobby where  it's like  when things can be a little bit bigger  maybe one a year type thing  um but yeah that's pretty much it  thank you all for watching i hope this  was at all interesting and not just  self-indulgent even if i had a fun time  talking about it  um because you know it was a very fun  creative expression  um and that is it for me today everyone  i will see you guys next time  bye


